  "operative_text": "Section 1 (R.C. 9.68(B)): A person, group, or entity adversely affected by any manner of ordinance, rule, regulation, resolution, practice, or other action enacted or enforced by a political subdivision in conflict with division (A) of this section may bring a civil action against the political subdivision seeking damages, including punitive or exemplary damages, from the political subdivision, declaratory relief, injunctive relief, or a combination of those remedies."
